  "body": "Automated bridge job `RQ-FIX-PHANTOM-4054` (pool: devin-flash), single commit on base `7812232a0`.\n\n**Tests:** no test command\n\n**Tier-1 (CODEOWNERS) paths, async post-merge review:** .github/CODEOWNERS src/core/routing/selector.ts test/config/realio-lane-membership.mjs test/fixtures/authority/tier1-closure.json test/fleet-self-loop-02soly1.test.ts test/fleet-self-loop-stream-02solc1.test.ts test/verse-api-mount-310.test.ts test/verse-workbench-contracts-310.test.ts\n\n<details><summary>Agent notes</summary>\n\n# BRIDGE_NOTES — RQ-FIX-PHANTOM-4054\n\n## Summary\n\nRebased the PR #4054 payload (`bridge: RQ-REBASE-PH-00`, head `71bee17987`)\nonto current `origin/master` (`4e4b2fa6e9`) and resolved all 61 merge\nconflicts. The payload's unique surface — report pages (`phm pages`,\n`/pages/<slug>` console route, pages API behind read authority), the fleet\nforum (API, MCP `phantom_forum`, mobile Forum screen, `forum` verse API\nmodule), COS decline/delivery semantics, `cos-work` self-tick step, docs-sync\ngenerated docs, and the fleet path-cochanges MCP hardening — is preserved on\ntop of master's newer fleet self-tick incident steps, remote-gateway policy,\nagent bus/leader/desktop MCP tools, and mac dispatcher empty-gate\nimplementation (`task_hash` / `with_prompt` / `TASK_EMPTY_REPEAT`).\n\nNotable merge decisions:\n\n- Self-tick step order is the union: master's 11 steps plus the payload's\n  `cos-work` last (12 steps); all self-tick/loop/stream test expectations\n  updated to the combined order.\n- `src/mcp/fleet-server.ts` and `src/core/mcp-native.ts` had duplicated\n  declarations from overlapping merges (`fleet_path_cochanges`,\n  `fleet_job_current_snapshot`, `phantom_fleet_apps_watch`); duplicates removed,\n  keeping master's `mcp-native-fleet.ts` registration as canonical.\n- `src/core/cos/decline.ts` keeps master's atomic `boundCosDraft` + `wx`\n  delivery claim + `closeCosNeedsYou`, extended to distinguish\n  `No chief-of-staff draft` / `Invalid chief-of-staff job id` /\n  `Explicit decline of the current draft is required` per the payload tests;\n  `fleet-cos-decline` CLI surfaces the static error message in JSON.\n- `test/mcp-output-efficiency.test.ts` inventory count is 88; the payload's\n  forum/fleet-orders/graph/session/verbs tools got their own measured byte\n  group (2,016 bytes, no headroom) alongside master's per-group budgets.\n- `test/mcp/fleet-path-cochanges-04-sqd1.test.ts` now asserts both `~` home\n  scrubbing and `[REDACTED]` GitHub-token scrubbing.\n- `npm run authority:regen` regenerated `.github/CODEOWNERS`,\n  `test/fixtures/authority/tier1-closure.json` and the MCP snapshot for the\n  payload's new Tier-1 roots (forum-api, pages, intent, etc.).\n- `node scripts/docs-sync.mjs` regenerated `docs/cli.md`,\n  `docs/CLI-REFERENCE.md`, `docs/llms.txt`, `docs/CODEMAP.md`,\n  `docs/QUICKSTART.md`, `examples/quickstart.md`, `site/llms-full.txt`.\n- contrib/mac dispatcher files kept master's newer empty-gate implementation;\n  the payload's older variant was superseded.\n\n## Commands run\n\n- `git fetch origin master` / `git fetch --deepen=2000 origin master`\n- `npm run install:worktree` (pnpm 10.28.2, shared store)\n- `npm run docs:sync`\n- `npm run typecheck:fast` — clean\n- `npm run check:docs` — clean (0 errors)\n- `node scripts/verify-changed.mjs` — all PASS (file selection, fleet registry,\n  authority drift after `npm run authority:regen`, eslint changed files,\n  tsgo, web typecheck, realio + verse-sync-io lints)\n- `npm run test:ci -- <files>` with `HOME=$(mktemp -d)`:\n  - self-tick family (10 files): 70/70 passed\n  - verse/cos/forum/mcp batch (23 files): 251 passed, 4 failed — all four were\n    load-related 5 s timeouts in `verse-api-mount-310` and\n    `verse-fleet-cos-api`; both files rerun alone: 41/41 passed\n  - `test/cos-decline.test.ts`, `test/m31.contract-lock.test.ts`,\n    `test/mcp-output-efficiency.test.ts`: 14/14 passed after fixes\n- `npx vitest run --config vitest.config.web.ts` on touched web files:\n  mobile-model, ForumScreen, FleetMissionPane passed; `every-pane-sweep` and\n  `font-ranges` fail identically on a clean `origin/master` archive checkout\n  (pre-existing master failures, unrelated to this change — covered by live\n  RQ-PHX-REDTEST* claims)\n- Secret-shape scan of the full staged diff for common token patterns: clean\n\n## Pass/fail counts\n\n- Backend touched suites: ~380 tests run, all passing after fixes\n  (2 timeout flakes passed on isolated rerun)\n- Web touched suites: 137 passed; 7 failures reproduced identically on\n  unmodified `origin/master` (pre-existing, not introduced here)\n- typecheck / lint / docs / authority: all green\n\n## Net LOC\n\n140 files changed, +9,131 / −226 (net +8,905) vs `origin/master` merge base,\nincluding regenerated docs, CODEOWNERS and authority closure fixtures.\n</details>\n",
